    <Description>Hello guys,

This macro is for AA (Auto Attack) and F2 (Best for AOE) Spots in DMW (Digimon Masters World) in this private server there are spot's that have fast respawn rate. So, this macro is to farm in this spots. 

- BEST USE FOR DIGIMON HAVE FAST COOL DOWN AOE SKILL. ETC SUSA, ICYMAGNA, FANGLOONG
- Simple Macro
- F2 Skill for Fast Killing (AOE skill will be better)
- W and S to short movement (just to kill mobs that moves in the spot)
- ID Magnetic required
</Description>
